# Two real clients and items (run-ui-flows.ps1 flow "two_clients_items"), side A: an Aydor warrior
# (sword + shield) waits until the Kargan rogue of side B (two_items_b.voscript) has walked over,
# then swaps to the two-handed axe; B must see the change (ENTITY_EQUIP). A also checks B's two
# daggers (ENTITY_SPAWN). Template ids: 1 sword, 2 shield, 3 dagger, 6 axe.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m8_two_a
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Kalkanli
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded 1800
scene expectequip main 1 off 2
waitfor world+remotes1 3600
scene expectremoteequip Gozcu 3 3
scene markremote Gozcu
# B walks over to us (stopping 3 m away), takes its screenshot of our sword and shield, then steps
# aside: that step is the signal to swap to the axe.
waitfor world+remotemoved 3600
waitfor world+remotenear4 1800
wait 20
scene markremote Gozcu
waitfor world+remotemoved 1800
scene itemmove bag0 main
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene expectequip main 6 off 0
scene camera behind 25 7
wait 20
screenshot a01_axe_next_to_rogue.png
# Stay until B has seen the axe and left.
waitfor world+remotes0 3600
quit
